  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Enhancing Governance, Transparency and Accountability in Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to help the ability of the Ministry of Education (MEN) to monitor the performance of the education system and, more specifically, strengthen the ability of the MEN to collect and analyze locally generated data about processes (e.g. resource use), outputs, and intermediate outcomes (e.g. service coverage and quality) to enhance accountability and transparency as well as to feed into strategy and policy making. The development objective of the grant is to strengthen the capacity of the Ministry of Education-MEN to monitor the performance of the education system and, more specifically, strengthen its ability to collect and analyze locally generated data on processes (e.g. resource use), outputs, and intermediate outcomes (e.g. service coverage and quality) to enhance accountability and transparency.</narrative>
  </description>
